plot
  Rags to Riches: An NPC is attempting to ascend from poverty or powerlessness to a higher status. 
  The Quest: This is the journey to get something or reach a location.^4
  Rebirth: Someone must become better to a happy ending. 
  Overcoming the Monster: A dangerous enemy or force must be conquered or destroyed. 
  Comedy: Through a seemingly (or actual) absurd situation there is the potential for a happy ending.
  Tragedy: A character is undone by a tragic flaw.
  Voyage and Return: A journey to an extraordinary place will give change someone.^2
  
